"StatWeb/Methods/Classifications TARGET=_blank>opis in pojasnila</A>).#Raven NUTS 2: Podatki o spremembah posameznih kohezijskih regij so dostopni na <A class=seznam HREF=https://www.stat.si/StatWeb/File/DocSysFile/9428/ TARGET=_blank>povezavi</A>.#Raven "
"NUTS 3: Podatki o spremembah posameznih statistiènih regij so dostopni na <A class=seznam HREF=https://www.stat.si/StatWeb/File/DocSysFile/9430/ TARGET=_blank>povezavi</A>.";
NOTE[en]("COHESION AND STATISTICAL REGION")="Data are territorially classsified according to The Classification of Territorial Units for Statistics – NUTS, (<A class='seznam' HREF=https://www.stat.si/StatWeb/en/Methods/Classifications TARGET=_"
"blank>description and explanations</A>).#Level NUTS 2: Data on changes of individual cohesion regions are available at the <A class=seznam HREF=https://www.stat.si/StatWeb/File/DocSysFile/9429/ TARGET=_blank>link</A>.#Level NUTS 3: Data on changes of "
"individual statistical regions are available at the <A class=seznam HREF=https://www.stat.si/StatWeb/File/DocSysFile/9431/ TARGET=_blank>link</A>.";
